<section class="psi-ev" id="psi-ev-hybrid" aria-labelledby="psi-ev-title">
  <div class="psi-ev__hero">
    <div class="psi-ev__hero-inner">
      <div class="psi-ev__hero-copy">
        <p class="psi-ev__eyebrow">EV &amp; Hybrid servicing · PSI Performance</p>
        <h1 id="psi-ev-title"><span>Modern cars.</span><span class="psi-ev__blue">Modern care.</span><span>Same PSI.</span></h1>
        <p class="psi-ev__lead">Professional servicing, diagnostics and underbody care for hybrid, plug in hybrid and battery electric vehicles, alongside the petrol and diesel vehicles PSI is known for.</p>
        <div class="psi-ev__actions"><a class="psi-ev__button" href="/#booking-panel">Book your vehicle</a><a class="psi-ev__button psi-ev__button--outline" href="#psi-ev-services">View EV services</a></div>
      </div>
      <aside class="psi-ev__power" aria-label="Supported powertrains">
        <small>One workshop · broader capability</small>
        <h2>Petrol. Diesel.<br><span>Hybrid. Electric.</span></h2>
        <div class="psi-ev__power-grid">
          <div><strong>Petrol</strong><span>Servicing, diagnostics, repairs and performance.</span></div>
          <div><strong>Diesel</strong><span>Maintenance, fault finding and workshop care.</span></div>
          <div><strong>HEV / PHEV</strong><span>Hybrid systems, cooling, brakes and inspections.</span></div>
          <div><strong>BEV</strong><span>EV servicing, charging faults and diagnostics.</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="psi-ev__process"><strong>Inspect</strong><strong>Diagnose</strong><strong>Explain</strong><strong>Repair</strong></div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="psi-ev__section" id="psi-ev-services">
    <div class="psi-ev__section-head">
      <div><p class="psi-ev__eyebrow">EV &amp; Hybrid workshop services</p><h2>The essentials,<br>handled properly.</h2></div>
      <p>Choose EV or Hybrid when booking in the PSI app. Tell us what the vehicle is doing and PSI will review the correct workshop scope before confirming your visit.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="psi-ev__services">
      <article class="psi-ev__service psi-ev__service--featured"><span>Maintenance</span><h3>Scheduled EV &amp; hybrid servicing</h3><p>Routine maintenance, condition checks and a clear record of the work completed.</p></article>
      <article class="psi-ev__service"><span>Diagnostics</span><h3>Warning lights &amp; fault finding</h3><p>Structured diagnosis for warning messages, driveability concerns and system faults.</p></article>
      <article class="psi-ev__service"><span>Safety</span><h3>High voltage system inspection</h3><p>Visual and diagnostic inspection of relevant high voltage vehicle systems.</p></article>
      <article class="psi-ev__service"><span>Charging</span><h3>Charging fault diagnosis</h3><p>Investigation of vehicle charging concerns and related electrical faults.</p></article>
      <article class="psi-ev__service"><span>Electrical</span><h3>12V battery &amp; electrical faults</h3><p>Testing and diagnosis of the 12V system that supports the vehicle electronics.</p></article>
      <article class="psi-ev__service"><span>Chassis</span><h3>Brakes, suspension &amp; tyres</h3><p>Mechanical care, wheel alignment and wear checks suited to heavier electrified vehicles.</p></article>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="psi-ev__systems">
    <div class="psi-ev__section psi-ev__systems-inner">
      <div><p class="psi-ev__eyebrow">A complete vehicle approach</p><h2>More than a battery check.</h2><p class="psi-ev__lead psi-ev__lead--small">EVs and hybrids still rely on cooling, braking, suspension, tyres and 12V electronics. PSI looks at the vehicle as a complete system.</p><div class="psi-ev__note">Battery pack rebuilding is not part of the initial service offering. PSI will explain the next step if specialist battery repair is required.</div></div>
      <div class="psi-ev__systems-list">
        <div><strong>Battery, inverter &amp; motor cooling</strong><span>↗</span></div>
        <div><strong>Regenerative &amp; conventional braking</strong><span>↗</span></div>
        <div><strong>Suspension, steering &amp; wheel alignment</strong><span>↗</span></div>
        <div><strong>Tyres, wear patterns &amp; vehicle weight</strong><span>↗</span></div>
        <div><strong>12V electrical &amp; charging concerns</strong><span>↗</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="psi-ev__charging">
    <div class="psi-ev__charging-inner">
      <div>
        <p class="psi-ev__eyebrow">Charging &amp; electrified performance</p>
        <h2>Charging faults.<br><span>Diagnosed properly.</span></h2>
        <p>From the charge port and onboard systems to the 12V supply that supports them, PSI can investigate vehicle charging concerns and explain the right next step.</p>
        <div class="psi-ev__chips"><span>Charging port checks</span><span>Onboard diagnostics</span><span>12V support systems</span><span>Clear findings</span></div>
      </div>
      <figure><img src="{{ 'ev-charging-tesla-v2.png' | asset_url }}" alt="White Tesla Model 3 Performance connected to a workshop charging station" width="1672" height="941" loading="lazy"></figure>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="psi-ev__workshop">
    <figure><img src="{{ 'ev-byd-porsche-workshop-v4.png' | asset_url }}" alt="White BYD Shark plug in hybrid and graphite Porsche 911 992.2 Turbo S outside a performance workshop" width="1860" height="845" loading="lazy"></figure>
    <div class="psi-ev__workshop-copy">
      <p class="psi-ev__eyebrow">Same standards · broader capability</p>
      <h2>One workshop.<br><span>Every powertrain.</span></h2>
      <p>PSI Performance remains the workshop you already know. EV &amp; Hybrid is an extension of the same focus on clear communication, accurate diagnosis and careful vehicle work.</p>
      <ul><li>Clear inspection findings and recommended next steps</li><li>Workshop photos, invoices and records in the PSI app</li><li>No separate EV brand or confusing booking process</li><li>Petrol, diesel, hybrid and electric under one PSI account</li></ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="psi-ev__booking">
    <div><p class="psi-ev__eyebrow">Ready to book?</p><h2>Select your powertrain.<br>Tell PSI what you need.</h2><p>Open Service &amp; Report in the PSI app, choose Petrol, Diesel, Hybrid, Plug in Hybrid or Electric, then select the relevant service options.</p></div>
    <div class="psi-ev__actions"><a class="psi-ev__button" href="https://apps.apple.com/au/app/psi-performance-garage/id6806902732">Open the PSI app</a><a class="psi-ev__button psi-ev__button--outline" href="/#booking-panel">Book on the website</a></div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .psi-ev{--blue:#65cff8;--ice:#dbe3e7;--line:#30383d;--panel:#111416;--black:#050505;--white:#fff;background:var(--black);color:var(--white);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;overflow:hidden}.psi-ev *{box-sizing:border-box}.psi-ev a{color:inherit}.psi-ev__hero{position:relative;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:radial-gradient(circle at 76% 40%,rgba(101,207,248,.16),transparent 31%),linear-gradient(115deg,#050505 0 48%,#0c1114 100%)}.psi-ev__hero:before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(101,207,248,.035) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(101,207,248,.035) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:58px 58px;mask-image:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent 34%,#000)}.psi-ev__hero-inner{position:relative;width:min(1460px,calc(100% - 48px));min-height:700px;margin:auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.02fr) minmax(460px,.98fr);align-items:center;gap:70px;padding:86px 0}.psi-ev__eyebrow{margin:0 0 22px;color:var(--blue);font-size:13px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.25em;text-transform:uppercase}.psi-ev__hero h1{margin:0;font-size:clamp(50px,5.2vw,92px);font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-.055em;line-height:.91;text-transform:uppercase}.psi-ev__hero h1 span{display:block;white-space:nowrap}.psi-ev__blue,.psi-ev h2 span{color:var(--blue)}.psi-ev__lead{max-width:720px;margin:30px 0 0;color:#cbd2d6;font-size:20px;line-height:1.55}.psi-ev__lead--small{font-size:16px}.psi-ev__actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin-top:35px}.psi-ev__button{min-height:58px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:0 24px;border:1px solid var(--ice);background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff,var(--ice));color:#050505!important;font-size:12px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.08em;text-decoration:none;text-transform:uppercase}.psi-ev__button--outline{background:transparent;color:#fff!important;border-color:var(--blue)}.psi-ev__button:hover{box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(101,207,248,.2)}
  .psi-ev__power{position:relative;min-height:430px;border:1px solid #49545a;border-left:5px solid var(--blue);background:linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(20,26,29,.96),rgba(7,10,12,.96));box-shadow:0 30px 90px rgba(0,0,0,.5),0 0 55px rgba(101,207,248,.08);padding:34px}.psi-ev__power small{color:#9aa4a9;font-size:10px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase}.psi-ev__power h2{max-width:420px;margin:16px 0 28px;font-size:36px;line-height:1.05;text-transform:uppercase}.psi-ev__power-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px}.psi-ev__power-grid>div{padding:17px 16px;border:1px solid #40505a;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#10161a,#090b0c)}.psi-ev__power-grid strong{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;color:#fff;font-size:18px}.psi-ev__power-grid strong:before{content:"✓";color:var(--blue);font-size:13px}.psi-ev__power-grid span{display:block;margin-top:5px;color:#9aa5aa;font-size:11px;line-height:1.4}.psi-ev__process{border-top:1px solid var(--line);display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);margin-top:30px}.psi-ev__process strong{padding:18px 12px;border-right:1px solid var(--line);text-align:center;color:var(--blue);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase}.psi-ev__process strong:last-child{border:0}
  .psi-ev__section{width:min(1460px,calc(100% - 48px));margin:auto;padding:100px 0}.psi-ev__section-head{display:flex;align-items:end;justify-content:space-between;gap:40px;margin-bottom:46px}.psi-ev__section h2,.psi-ev__charging h2,.psi-ev__booking h2{margin:0;font-size:clamp(38px,4vw,68px);letter-spacing:-.04em;line-height:.98;text-transform:uppercase}.psi-ev__section-head>p{max-width:560px;margin:0;color:#aeb6bb;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6}.psi-ev__services{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px}.psi-ev__service{min-height:250px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:linear-gradient(155deg,#131719,#090b0c);padding:28px;transition:.2s}.psi-ev__service:hover{border-color:var(--blue);transform:translateY(-3px)}.psi-ev__service>span{color:var(--blue);font-size:11px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase}.psi-ev__service h3{margin:42px 0 12px;color:#fff;font-size:24px;line-height:1.05;text-transform:uppercase}.psi-ev__service p{margin:0;color:#9da6ab;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6}.psi-ev__service--featured{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#12313d,#0b1317);border-color:var(--blue)}
  .psi-ev__systems{border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:#0a0c0d}.psi-ev__systems-inner{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.8fr 1.2fr;gap:80px;align-items:start}.psi-ev__systems-list{border-top:1px solid #3a4348}.psi-ev__systems-list>div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 36px;align-items:center;gap:14px;padding:23px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #30383d}.psi-ev__systems-list strong{font-size:19px}.psi-ev__systems-list span{color:var(--blue);font-size:22px}.psi-ev__note{margin-top:25px;padding:18px 20px;border-left:3px solid var(--blue);background:#101518;color:#b8c1c5;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6}
  .psi-ev__charging{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:radial-gradient(circle at 85% 50%,rgba(101,207,248,.12),transparent 32%),#050505}.psi-ev__charging-inner{width:min(1460px,calc(100% - 48px));margin:auto;padding:100px 0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:.75fr 1.25fr;gap:60px;align-items:center}.psi-ev__charging h2 span{color:var(--blue)}.psi-ev__charging p:not(.psi-ev__eyebrow){color:#aeb6bb;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7}.psi-ev__chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:9px;margin-top:26px}.psi-ev__chips span{padding:11px 13px;border:1px solid #344147;background:#0c1114;color:#dbe3e7;font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase}.psi-ev__charging figure{position:relative;margin:0;border:1px solid #465158;border-bottom:4px solid var(--blue);background:#090b0c;box-shadow:0 28px 80px rgba(0,0,0,.5);overflow:hidden}.psi-ev__charging img{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}
  .psi-ev__workshop{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr;align-items:start;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.psi-ev__workshop figure{margin:0;align-self:start;overflow:hidden;background:#07090a}.psi-ev__workshop img{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}.psi-ev__workshop-copy{padding:18px clamp(24px,2.4vw,44px)}.psi-ev__workshop-copy .psi-ev__eyebrow{margin-bottom:10px;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.18em;white-space:nowrap}.psi-ev__workshop-copy h2{margin:0;font-size:clamp(34px,3vw,52px);line-height:.94;letter-spacing:-.045em;text-transform:uppercase}.psi-ev__workshop-copy>p:not(.psi-ev__eyebrow){margin:12px 0 0;color:#aeb6bb;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5}.psi-ev__workshop-copy ul{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:12px 0 0;display:grid;gap:6px}.psi-ev__workshop-copy li{position:relative;padding-left:22px;color:#dbe3e7;font-size:12px;line-height:1.2;font-weight:700}.psi-ev__workshop-copy li:before{content:"✓";position:absolute;left:0;color:var(--blue)}
  .psi-ev__booking{padding:82px max(24px,calc((100% - 1460px)/2));display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;align-items:center;gap:60px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0d2731,#091014 55%,#050505);border-top:1px solid rgba(101,207,248,.35)}.psi-ev__booking p:not(.psi-ev__eyebrow){max-width:750px;color:#c1c9cd;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55}
  @media(max-width:980px){.psi-ev__hero-inner{width:min(100% - 38px,1460px);grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:65px 0;gap:38px}.psi-ev__hero h1{font-size:clamp(48px,10vw,80px)}.psi-ev__power{min-height:auto}.psi-ev__section{width:min(100% - 38px,1460px);padding:70px 0}.psi-ev__section-head{display:block}.psi-ev__section-head>p{margin-top:20px}.psi-ev__services{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.psi-ev__systems-inner{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:45px}.psi-ev__charging-inner{width:min(100% - 38px,1460px);grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:70px 0}.psi-ev__charging figure{order:-1}.psi-ev__workshop{grid-template-columns:1fr}.psi-ev__workshop-copy{padding:45px 24px 70px}.psi-ev__booking{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:70px 24px}}
  @media(max-width:620px){.psi-ev__hero-inner{padding-top:48px}.psi-ev__hero h1{font-size:clamp(38px,11.3vw,49px)}.psi-ev__lead{font-size:17px}.psi-ev__actions .psi-ev__button{width:100%}.psi-ev__power{padding:24px 20px}.psi-ev__power h2{font-size:29px}.psi-ev__power-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.psi-ev__process{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.psi-ev__services{grid-template-columns:1fr}.psi-ev__service{min-height:210px}.psi-ev__charging-inner{width:min(100% - 30px,1460px);gap:36px}.psi-ev__booking{padding-bottom:50px}}
</style>

